      "Language": "dut",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A diversity of painkillers is available on the market. One may make an appropriate choice among them, based on the causative factors of the pain and recognizing both their therapeutic features and side-effects. This article tries to facilitate the choice, by describing the more important (groups of) painkillers."},
